  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有些玩家不喜歡戰鎚的材質，我也是其中之一。看到重擊核心的三維材質時會感到違和，但合成出來卻變成二維的戰鎚……也許這是我的問題。</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsketchfab.com%252f3d-models%252fmace-minecraft-4f89e27c7ffe406c97bdcb1684b47595\" rel=\"nofollow\">戰鎚模型（點擊預覽）</a></strong><strong><br></strong></h3>\n<h3><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9f4c58af-41e9-4b1d-9c64-fb947055dc68.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"437\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>畫面介面中的戰鎚</strong></h3>\n<h3><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a1cebac8-c5d6-4743-b094-30586e0cc5d8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"473\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
